WEBVTT

01:50.360 --> 01:50.960
Mr. Sun,

01:52.759 --> 01:53.840
what happened to my dad?

01:55.759 --> 01:56.840
Don't worry too much.

01:57.720 --> 01:58.800
They just took your dad away

01:59.000 --> 02:00.000
for questioning.

02:00.560 --> 02:01.600
Do I really have to leave?

02:02.320 --> 02:03.200
The creditors

02:03.200 --> 02:04.240
are after you now

02:04.800 --> 02:05.680
and we have to take you

02:05.680 --> 02:07.000
to a safe place right away.

02:07.400 --> 02:08.759
But I have my own plans.

02:09.280 --> 02:10.039
I've got the

02:10.039 --> 02:10.759
prep school admission letter.

02:11.400 --> 02:12.680
I wanna study abroad as my mom

02:12.680 --> 02:13.440
wished.

02:13.840 --> 02:14.440
Ye,

02:15.560 --> 02:16.680
your father's assets

02:16.800 --> 02:17.880
have been frozen.

02:18.320 --> 02:19.360
It'll be tough to get a visa.

02:20.160 --> 02:21.280
You have no other relatives

02:21.400 --> 02:22.360
here in Beijing.

02:22.840 --> 02:24.079
I need to focus fully on

02:24.079 --> 02:25.160
your father's case.

02:25.440 --> 02:26.440
I can't rest easy

02:27.280 --> 02:28.360
if you stay in Beijing.

02:32.920 --> 02:33.960
Where are we going now?

02:34.600 --> 02:35.200
Zhazhating.

02:35.560 --> 02:36.400
We'll go to your aunt's.

02:37.240 --> 02:38.480
Zhazhating?

03:00.200 --> 03:00.680
Step aside!

03:00.840 --> 03:01.360
Freeze!

03:01.560 --> 03:02.520
- Stop!
- Make way!

03:02.800 --> 03:03.360
Step away!

03:04.520 --> 03:05.720
Don't move!

03:07.720 --> 03:08.520
Excuse me!

03:08.560 --> 03:09.160
Excuse me!

03:09.280 --> 03:09.960
Wu Laoer!

03:10.720 --> 03:11.280
Wu Laoer!

03:11.560 --> 03:12.560
Coming through!

03:12.560 --> 03:13.120
Move!

03:13.160 --> 03:13.760
Move!

03:13.800 --> 03:14.400
Wu Laoer!

03:16.360 --> 03:17.040
Wu!

03:17.320 --> 03:17.920
Wu!

03:18.200 --> 03:18.960
What's going on?

03:37.320 --> 03:39.240
Catch the thief!

03:39.320 --> 03:40.160
Wu Laoer stole

03:40.160 --> 03:40.800
Mr. Zhu's phone.

03:41.520 --> 03:42.040
What happened?

03:42.040 --> 03:42.840
How dare he!

03:43.520 --> 03:44.520
Mr. Zhu's phone got stolen.

03:44.760 --> 03:45.560
Mr. Zhu?

03:45.960 --> 03:46.800
Was it Wu Laoer?

03:46.840 --> 03:47.400
Exactly.

03:48.040 --> 03:48.720
Wu,

03:48.920 --> 03:50.120
don't forget to pick up your cousin.

03:50.480 --> 03:51.000
Got it.

03:51.000 --> 03:52.200
Follow me, Wu.

03:52.320 --> 03:53.160
- Take care.
- Hurry!

03:53.680 --> 03:54.680
Stay safe!

04:03.200 --> 04:03.840
Wu Laoer!

04:04.760 --> 04:05.840
Look who it is!

04:05.880 --> 04:06.920
Steal things again!

04:06.920 --> 04:08.440
Never stays out of trouble.

04:14.800 --> 04:15.480
Let's split up!

04:15.720 --> 04:16.600
- Okay.
- Got it.

04:28.120 --> 04:29.040
Wu Laoer!

04:32.400 --> 04:33.520
Hurry up! Kyle!

04:52.200 --> 04:52.760
What's wrong?

04:53.080 --> 04:54.240
What the hell?

04:54.800 --> 04:56.120
The GPS seems off.

05:27.840 --> 05:28.560
[OMG.]

05:29.040 --> 05:30.240
[Shamates...]

05:31.960 --> 05:32.520
You!

05:35.080 --> 05:35.520
Bastard!

05:37.120 --> 05:37.680
Where's the phone?

05:37.840 --> 05:38.600
What phone?

05:40.680 --> 05:41.760
Don't play dumb.

05:42.120 --> 05:43.280
The road is covered with cameras.

05:43.360 --> 05:44.600
How dare you steal the teacher's phone?

05:44.600 --> 05:45.080
Huh?

05:45.280 --> 05:46.480
Wait, what are you talking about?

05:49.400 --> 05:50.240
Wu! Wait!

05:50.440 --> 05:51.200
I just stole a phone.

05:51.200 --> 05:52.400
No need to do that.

05:52.520 --> 05:53.159
Give it to me!

05:53.560 --> 05:54.840
You're pinning me down.

05:54.840 --> 05:55.560
How can I get it out?

06:09.640 --> 06:10.320
What are you doing?

06:10.800 --> 06:11.680
The phone!

06:24.040 --> 06:24.600
Kyle!

06:26.440 --> 06:26.960
Big G!

06:28.680 --> 06:29.160
Take it.

06:29.520 --> 06:30.000
I...

06:44.080 --> 06:44.640
Fuck off!

06:53.440 --> 06:54.280
A Beijing plate car.

06:54.680 --> 06:55.360
Looks really fancy.

06:55.800 --> 06:56.320
Wu.

06:56.720 --> 06:57.240
Is that...

06:57.320 --> 06:58.680
our cousin's car?

07:01.080 --> 07:01.600
Ye,

07:02.520 --> 07:03.320
I know that

07:03.600 --> 07:05.120
the surroundings and locals here

07:05.200 --> 07:06.160
are a bit different

07:06.240 --> 07:07.080
from what you expected.

07:07.520 --> 07:08.920
But there are relatives looking after you here.

07:10.160 --> 07:11.880
I've told them over and over again

07:12.480 --> 07:14.520
to keep you safe at all costs.

07:15.000 --> 07:16.320
It's way more than just a little different.

07:17.560 --> 07:19.160
I just saw three people picking on one

07:19.680 --> 07:20.720
and acting shamelessly everywhere.

07:23.520 --> 07:24.040
Ye,

07:25.320 --> 07:26.400
it's none of your business.

07:26.520 --> 07:27.320
Just take it easy.

07:27.440 --> 07:28.480
I don't care.

07:35.840 --> 07:37.159
What's this?

08:08.200 --> 08:08.840
Hey beauty.

08:10.280 --> 08:10.800
Good to see you.

08:11.200 --> 08:11.920
I'm

08:12.160 --> 08:13.160
Kyle Hao,

08:13.600 --> 08:14.920
the richest man in Zhazhating.

08:15.360 --> 08:16.120
What's wrong with you?

08:21.440 --> 08:22.440
You're from Beijing, right?

08:22.800 --> 08:23.720
None of your business.

08:25.880 --> 08:26.560
Buddy.

08:30.520 --> 08:31.480
You three

08:32.080 --> 08:32.799
locals?

08:33.200 --> 08:33.720
Yep.

08:34.000 --> 08:34.600
What's up?

08:34.720 --> 08:35.240
How can I

08:35.840 --> 08:36.799
get to Xuan Island?

08:38.240 --> 08:38.840
Xuan...

08:39.520 --> 08:40.520
Xuan Island?

08:40.720 --> 08:41.360
- Nah...
- Eh...

08:41.400 --> 08:41.960
100 yuan

08:44.280 --> 08:44.720
as your reward.

08:45.160 --> 08:45.840
100 yuan?

08:46.720 --> 08:47.840
Okay, 100 yuan for each of you.

08:51.520 --> 08:52.120
No.

08:52.400 --> 08:52.920
Enough?

08:53.480 --> 08:54.160
No need to pay.

08:54.760 --> 08:55.480
It's opposite the lighthouse.

08:55.480 --> 08:56.600
You'll see a row of red houses.

08:57.120 --> 08:58.680
Go straight along this road

08:59.000 --> 09:00.280
about one kilometer to the main road,

09:00.360 --> 09:02.280
turn left twice at the roundabout

09:02.400 --> 09:04.040
and follow the small path till the end.

09:04.680 --> 09:05.360
What a winding route!

09:05.800 --> 09:07.160
No wonder the GPS got confused.

09:07.400 --> 09:07.960
Take this.

09:09.360 --> 09:09.880
Thank you.

09:10.400 --> 09:11.200
You city folks are really generous.

09:12.120 --> 09:12.680
Return it.

09:13.560 --> 09:15.240
They got into the car.

09:15.480 --> 09:17.360
Such a generous spender!

09:20.720 --> 09:21.320
Mr. Sun,

09:22.480 --> 09:23.480
is this what you call

09:23.840 --> 09:24.680
honest folk?

09:25.360 --> 09:26.040
In a small town,

09:26.800 --> 09:27.560
money talks

09:28.120 --> 09:29.000
and all issues will get sorted.

10:05.160 --> 10:05.760
Mr. Zhu.

10:05.800 --> 10:06.400
Mr. Zhu.

10:19.800 --> 10:20.480
Look at your hair!

10:20.480 --> 10:21.240
Such weird colors!

10:22.000 --> 10:22.720
Do you even look like students?

10:22.720 --> 10:23.600
Ouch, that hurts.

10:25.160 --> 10:25.800
Where's Wu Laoer?

10:26.160 --> 10:27.160
Don't worry. We found him.

10:27.480 --> 10:28.480
You can trust Wu.

10:30.880 --> 10:31.400
It's here.

10:42.720 --> 10:43.800
Check if anything's wrong.

10:43.880 --> 10:44.840
Seems all fine.

10:44.840 --> 10:45.440
But what's that smell?

10:45.440 --> 10:46.160
If everything's fine,

10:46.800 --> 10:47.360
we'll leave.

10:49.680 --> 10:50.480
You two head back first.

10:50.760 --> 10:51.320
Xing Wu,

10:51.920 --> 10:52.520
come with me.

10:52.560 --> 10:53.200
I need a word with you.

10:56.880 --> 10:57.680
You two take the shortcut

10:57.760 --> 10:58.920
to tell my mom

10:59.200 --> 10:59.880
our cousin will arrive soon.

11:00.160 --> 11:00.600
Okay.

11:04.280 --> 11:06.400
South wind first, good fortune all the way.

11:07.400 --> 11:07.920
See you.

11:08.240 --> 11:09.120
West wind.

11:09.840 --> 11:10.560
Fangfang,

11:11.160 --> 11:12.280
Your makeup

11:12.320 --> 11:13.520
looks really fancy today.

11:13.840 --> 11:14.680
Just so-so.

11:15.880 --> 11:16.880
Got any big plans?

11:18.320 --> 11:20.080
My niece is coming

11:20.080 --> 11:20.840
from Beijing soon.

11:22.400 --> 11:23.240
Fangfang,

11:23.480 --> 11:25.400
I've heard your niece

11:25.680 --> 11:27.120
will give you 50,000 yuan.

11:28.640 --> 11:29.440
That's a huge sum.

11:31.400 --> 11:33.160
You'll be well-off then.

11:33.600 --> 11:34.840
Enough to pay off all debts.

11:35.680 --> 11:37.720
Who spread that gossip?

11:38.960 --> 11:39.680
Don't you remember?

11:40.040 --> 11:40.800
You told me

11:40.800 --> 11:41.560
when you dried my hair

11:41.560 --> 11:42.680
last time in person.

11:43.000 --> 11:44.280
You sure have a bad memory.

11:45.760 --> 11:46.800
Fine.

11:47.240 --> 11:48.360
Guess I forgot.

11:48.920 --> 11:50.200
It's not about money.

11:50.200 --> 11:51.480
We're family after all.

11:51.480 --> 11:52.120
Taking care of her

11:52.120 --> 11:53.560
is only natural.

11:53.960 --> 11:54.680
I don't need payment.

11:55.200 --> 11:55.680
Fangfang,

11:55.880 --> 11:57.240
you've got relatives in the capital?

11:57.520 --> 11:58.480
Never heard you mention it.

11:59.320 --> 12:01.000
We haven't kept in touch much.

12:01.120 --> 12:02.320
She's my sister's daughter.

12:02.320 --> 12:03.120
Their family runs

12:03.120 --> 12:04.040
a big business.

12:04.600 --> 12:05.320
Really prosperous.

12:05.760 --> 12:07.120
But my sister passed away

12:07.120 --> 12:07.760
at an early age.

12:07.880 --> 12:08.960
It happened a couple of years before.

12:09.120 --> 12:09.960
My brother-in-law

12:10.040 --> 12:11.280
still acknowledges our kinship.

12:12.680 --> 12:13.720
I've already

12:13.720 --> 12:14.760
talked to him.

12:14.880 --> 12:15.680
In the future,

12:15.720 --> 12:16.920
he must come to invest

12:16.920 --> 12:17.880
and develop Zhazhating

12:17.960 --> 12:19.320
into a resort town.

12:19.360 --> 12:20.840
New buildings will be built too.

12:21.680 --> 12:22.360
I'll get each of you

12:22.360 --> 12:23.040
an apartment.

12:24.680 --> 12:25.440
Really?

12:25.480 --> 12:26.320
Thanks a lot.

12:26.560 --> 12:27.320
I'll hold you to that.

12:27.400 --> 12:28.200
Okay.

12:29.280 --> 12:30.120
Someone's calling.

12:32.120 --> 12:33.000
Pick up first.

12:33.760 --> 12:34.160
Okay.

12:40.760 --> 12:41.280
Hello.

12:43.320 --> 12:44.400
Calm down.

12:44.400 --> 12:45.560
I told you.

12:45.840 --> 12:47.240
Once the God of Wealth arrives,

12:47.680 --> 12:49.120
I'll transfer the money right away.

12:51.240 --> 12:52.360
Hello?

12:54.680 --> 12:55.880
Jesus!

13:01.720 --> 13:02.800
How stubborn you are!

13:03.600 --> 13:04.680
You've been persuading me into this

13:05.160 --> 13:06.080
for two years.

13:07.400 --> 13:08.040
You are

13:08.040 --> 13:09.800
my student after all.

13:11.000 --> 13:12.600
I just wanna talk with you.

13:12.600 --> 13:13.760
Just have a heart-to-heart chat.

13:13.760 --> 13:14.440
Nothing wrong with it.

13:16.680 --> 13:17.400
I heard that

13:18.400 --> 13:20.120
you've been fixing phones at Shunyi

13:20.640 --> 13:21.640
for almost two years.

13:22.040 --> 13:23.200
Are you really hooked on this job?

13:24.160 --> 13:25.840
You have no intention of going back to school

13:25.960 --> 13:26.600
and take college entrance exams?

13:27.440 --> 13:28.480
How do you know that

13:29.200 --> 13:30.720
going back guarantees a good university?

13:32.800 --> 13:34.000
I'm fine living like this now.

13:34.480 --> 13:35.920
As your teacher,

13:35.920 --> 13:37.200
I know you well.

13:37.600 --> 13:38.680
You just feel

13:39.600 --> 13:40.760
your mom struggles alone.

13:41.440 --> 13:42.480
She pays for your schooling,

13:42.760 --> 13:43.960
settles family debts

13:44.280 --> 13:45.040
and looks after

13:45.040 --> 13:45.960
your grandma.

13:46.360 --> 13:47.120
Life is tough for her.

13:47.120 --> 13:48.200
You wanna share her burden.

13:50.880 --> 13:51.280
But Xing Wu,

13:51.280 --> 13:52.920
think it through rationally.

13:53.160 --> 13:55.600
Resuming your studies right now

13:55.840 --> 13:57.640
and striving for a good college

13:57.680 --> 13:58.880
are the best reward

13:58.880 --> 14:00.080
you can give your mother.

14:01.800 --> 14:02.280
Listen.

14:03.040 --> 14:04.280
You used to be

14:04.280 --> 14:05.400
an outstanding student.

14:06.040 --> 14:07.400
Remember the paper plane contest

14:07.400 --> 14:08.240
in Zhazhating.

14:08.560 --> 14:09.840
Your plane flew the highest

14:09.840 --> 14:10.920
and farthest.

14:10.920 --> 14:11.560
Save it.

14:12.000 --> 14:13.400
It's just folding paper planes.

14:13.600 --> 14:14.520
Drop it.

14:14.800 --> 14:15.560
What about the

14:15.560 --> 14:16.440
model aircraft competition?

14:16.440 --> 14:17.440
You were also the champion.

14:17.440 --> 14:18.840
Wu Laoer was also your junior.

14:18.960 --> 14:19.440
Two years after leaving school

14:19.440 --> 14:20.240
and he still mucks around.

14:20.240 --> 14:22.080
Don't mention him.

14:22.080 --> 14:23.280
You two are totally different.

14:24.400 --> 14:26.320
Everyone walks their own path.

14:27.760 --> 14:29.400
Just like in Zhazhating,

14:30.400 --> 14:32.200
across one alley, accents change;

14:32.720 --> 14:34.120
across one ridge, customs range.

14:34.920 --> 14:36.000
In my

14:36.000 --> 14:36.760
opinion,

14:37.120 --> 14:38.520
you are a promising talent.

14:39.280 --> 14:40.880
Your mom had no choice

14:41.440 --> 14:42.920
but to suspend your schooling.

14:43.680 --> 14:45.280
Let bygones be bygones.

14:45.680 --> 14:46.840
Two years have passed.

14:46.840 --> 14:48.080
What's there to linger on?

14:53.800 --> 14:54.760
Still quarrel with your wife

14:55.120 --> 14:55.680
lately?

14:55.840 --> 14:57.040
He Xiaolian and I...

14:58.120 --> 14:59.160
We're talking about you.

14:59.160 --> 15:00.760
Why drag me into this?

15:01.120 --> 15:01.640
Xing Wu,

15:01.720 --> 15:02.320
I've talked to you

15:02.320 --> 15:03.560
so many times.

15:03.680 --> 15:05.000
Please think carefully.

15:07.040 --> 15:07.520
Finished?

15:08.400 --> 15:08.920
Okay.

15:09.800 --> 15:10.520
Goodbye, Mr. Zhu.

15:13.240 --> 15:14.760
Take your time to consider.

15:15.080 --> 15:16.400
Call me once you make up your mind.

15:19.000 --> 15:19.760
Auntie Fang.

15:20.160 --> 15:20.840
Cou...

15:21.520 --> 15:22.080
Auntie Fang,

15:23.000 --> 15:23.640
the cousin has arrived.

15:23.920 --> 15:24.960
Xing Wu asked me to inform you.

15:25.640 --> 15:26.200
My son,

15:26.680 --> 15:27.520
what happened to your hair?

15:27.960 --> 15:28.560
Who did it for you?

15:28.840 --> 15:29.880
It's me.

15:30.120 --> 15:31.040
I got new

15:31.040 --> 15:32.040
hair dye.

15:32.040 --> 15:33.560
They two dropped out of school.

15:33.560 --> 15:34.880
I just tried it out on them.

15:35.080 --> 15:36.480
But it looks really ugly!

15:36.480 --> 15:37.200
Standing there and

15:37.200 --> 15:38.480
they look like traffic lights.

15:38.800 --> 15:39.720
Please dye it back right away.

15:39.880 --> 15:41.240
Dye it back right away!

15:41.400 --> 15:41.760
Fine.

15:41.760 --> 15:42.560
They look like hooligans!

15:42.560 --> 15:43.400
Okay.

15:43.800 --> 15:44.640
Kyle, Big G,

15:45.240 --> 15:46.080
tell Liu Nian to

15:46.240 --> 15:47.600
to light firecrackers to welcome her!

15:47.760 --> 15:48.120
Okay!

15:48.120 --> 15:48.720
Okay!

15:48.760 --> 15:49.240
OMG.

15:49.680 --> 15:50.920
What a weird hairstyle!

15:51.120 --> 15:52.080
Take my bag please.

15:52.360 --> 15:54.480
I'm gonna greet my God of Wealth.

15:54.680 --> 15:55.480
Let's go together.

15:56.160 --> 15:56.840
Come on!

15:56.840 --> 15:57.480
I'll take it.

15:57.480 --> 15:57.920
Okay.

16:06.200 --> 16:06.800
She's coming!

16:16.880 --> 16:17.760
Really?

16:18.080 --> 16:19.240
Light the firecrackers!

16:50.200 --> 16:50.760
OMG!

16:51.280 --> 16:51.840
So lively!

16:51.840 --> 16:52.560
Welcome!

16:57.400 --> 16:58.000
Nice to meet you.

16:58.160 --> 16:59.200
Ye's aunt?

16:59.360 --> 17:00.120
Yes.

17:00.160 --> 17:00.600
Li Lanfang?

17:00.640 --> 17:01.360
Yes, it's me.

17:01.400 --> 17:02.240
We spoke on the phone.

17:03.000 --> 17:04.200
Secretary Sun Hai?

17:04.280 --> 17:04.800
It's me.

17:04.800 --> 17:05.520
Good to see you.

17:06.359 --> 17:06.920
She's Ye.

17:07.079 --> 17:07.560
Okay.

17:27.359 --> 17:28.280
Ye!

17:28.440 --> 17:29.880
Finally get to see you!

17:29.920 --> 17:30.320
Give me a hug.

17:32.080 --> 17:33.560
So stylish!

17:34.160 --> 17:35.640
Truly a city girl!

17:37.160 --> 17:38.360
You've grown so tall!

17:38.920 --> 17:39.800
Remember me?

17:39.920 --> 17:41.200
You visited here when you were a kid.

17:43.560 --> 17:44.520
Okay, fine.

17:44.760 --> 17:45.920
You're here now!

17:46.040 --> 17:46.560
Trust me.

17:46.760 --> 17:49.080
I, as your aunt,

17:49.360 --> 17:50.960
will take good care of you.

17:53.480 --> 17:54.240
Neighbors,

17:54.600 --> 17:56.600
this is my niece

17:56.720 --> 17:57.760
from Beijing,

17:57.800 --> 17:58.520
Qing Ye.

17:59.560 --> 18:00.480
Bravo!

18:00.560 --> 18:01.760
Welcome!

18:01.880 --> 18:03.000
Hope all of you

18:03.000 --> 18:04.360
look after her!

18:04.440 --> 18:05.440
Sure. No problem!

18:06.880 --> 18:07.480
Thank you all!

18:07.920 --> 18:08.400
Liu Nian,

18:08.440 --> 18:09.520
fetch the luggage.

18:11.400 --> 18:12.000
That's all!

18:12.160 --> 18:13.160
Thanks.

18:13.240 --> 18:13.720
Thank you.

18:14.160 --> 18:14.760
Brilliant!

18:14.760 --> 18:15.680
Let's go back home.

18:16.920 --> 18:17.960
Let's go inside.

18:19.080 --> 18:21.040
I need a word with Sun.

18:21.080 --> 18:21.920
Fine. Just go.

18:22.000 --> 18:22.840
We'll head in first.

18:23.240 --> 18:24.000
Hurry up, Liu Nian!

18:24.480 --> 18:24.960
Okay!

18:29.560 --> 18:30.160
Mr. Sun,

18:31.000 --> 18:32.360
you've worked for my dad for so many years.

18:32.840 --> 18:34.240
Please clear his name.

18:34.840 --> 18:35.800
I'll spare no effort

18:36.440 --> 18:37.560
to do that.

18:38.040 --> 18:38.600
Don't worry.

18:39.160 --> 18:39.760
Ye,

18:40.640 --> 18:42.000
take care of yourself.

18:42.480 --> 18:43.080
Call me

18:43.680 --> 18:44.680
whenever you want to.

18:45.200 --> 18:45.760
Bye.

19:09.680 --> 19:10.240
Ye,

19:11.800 --> 19:12.800
this is Xuan Island.

19:13.160 --> 19:14.200
Welcome to Xuan Island.

19:14.360 --> 19:15.480
This is my barbershop.

19:16.640 --> 19:18.120
It looks messy

19:18.520 --> 19:21.880
but well-organized actually.

19:23.240 --> 19:24.280
This is my apprentice, Liu Nian.

19:24.480 --> 19:24.920
Nice to meet you.

19:25.600 --> 19:27.200
Go sweep up the firecracker scraps

19:27.400 --> 19:28.360
or the neighbors may blame us.

19:28.560 --> 19:29.000
Okay.

19:42.880 --> 19:43.440
Thank you.

19:49.800 --> 19:50.480
30,000 yuan?

19:52.160 --> 19:53.440
We agreed on 50,000 yuan!

19:54.800 --> 19:55.760
This is the initial payment.

19:56.800 --> 19:58.400
Small as the

19:59.120 --> 20:00.040
place is,

20:00.360 --> 20:02.160
it has all

20:02.240 --> 20:03.080
facilities.

20:04.360 --> 20:05.680
The deal was 50,000 yuan,

20:05.760 --> 20:07.440
including board and lodging.

20:07.880 --> 20:08.960
Is something wrong?

20:09.440 --> 20:10.840
I won't stay long.

20:12.280 --> 20:13.120
Compared to a hotel,

20:14.000 --> 20:14.960
30,000 yuan is at least as much,

20:15.280 --> 20:16.040
if not more.

20:16.400 --> 20:17.360
The rest

20:17.720 --> 20:18.720
will be paid

20:19.360 --> 20:20.600
before I leave.

20:20.960 --> 20:21.600
Fine.

20:22.920 --> 20:23.840
Just stay here.

20:24.640 --> 20:26.120
We're family,

20:26.160 --> 20:26.760
aren't we?

20:27.120 --> 20:27.840
I promise

20:28.080 --> 20:28.920
I'll make you

20:28.920 --> 20:30.360
feel at home.

20:32.200 --> 20:32.880
This is my son,

20:33.360 --> 20:34.000
Xing Wu.

20:38.480 --> 20:40.040
This is your cousin from Beijing,

20:40.120 --> 20:40.760
Qing Ye.

20:52.000 --> 20:53.880
I'm going next door.

20:54.240 --> 20:54.840
Ugh...

20:54.880 --> 20:56.480
Show Qing Ye around

20:56.760 --> 20:57.440
later.

20:59.680 --> 21:00.880
I'm busy.

21:13.280 --> 21:13.800
Fine.

21:14.200 --> 21:15.240
I'll show you your room

21:15.760 --> 21:16.360
upstairs.

21:48.080 --> 21:48.640
Jesus...

21:49.280 --> 21:50.240
How many things are there

21:50.240 --> 21:51.480
in your luggage?

21:52.160 --> 21:53.920
It's so heavy!

21:56.760 --> 21:57.400
Come here.

21:58.280 --> 21:58.680
This way.

22:03.880 --> 22:06.040
My son fixes phones

22:06.600 --> 22:07.720
and gadgets right here.

22:11.160 --> 22:11.760
You can

22:12.440 --> 22:13.160
sleep here.

22:17.840 --> 22:18.440
Here?

22:19.600 --> 22:20.640
Is this your son's room?

22:21.280 --> 22:21.880
Of course.

22:22.440 --> 22:23.240
He barely stays home,

22:23.240 --> 22:24.280
always out running errands.

22:24.640 --> 22:25.880
It's a nice spot for you.

22:26.240 --> 22:28.400
Facing the sea, spring blossoms.

22:28.680 --> 22:29.400
You take this bed

22:30.480 --> 22:31.280
and he sleeps over there.

22:31.480 --> 22:32.840
If you feel awkward,

22:33.760 --> 22:34.720
I can hang a curtain.

22:35.600 --> 22:36.480
If that still

22:36.480 --> 22:37.680
doesn't work,

22:37.840 --> 22:39.080
I can put up a partition board.

22:39.680 --> 22:40.240
Is that okay?

22:40.800 --> 22:41.920
Any other options?

22:49.520 --> 22:50.640
Have a look

22:52.080 --> 22:53.360
at my room.

22:54.360 --> 22:55.480
Small

22:55.680 --> 22:58.080
but functional,

22:58.120 --> 22:59.160
cozy and well arranged.

23:00.800 --> 23:01.480
Take a look.

23:02.000 --> 23:02.880
You can live here.

23:03.400 --> 23:04.440
Just tidy it up a bit.

23:07.280 --> 23:07.840
So...

23:08.200 --> 23:08.800
which one?

23:11.960 --> 23:12.720
OMG...

23:13.480 --> 23:14.280
Don't be scared.

23:14.400 --> 23:15.120
It's alright.

23:16.280 --> 23:16.960
Liu Nian

23:17.080 --> 23:18.520
uses it to practice.

23:19.680 --> 23:20.280
Which one do you prefer?

23:20.880 --> 23:22.880
[Fang, we're waiting for you.]

23:23.000 --> 23:23.840
[Come on!]

23:24.200 --> 23:24.960
Coming.

23:25.800 --> 23:26.440
How about you

23:26.760 --> 23:28.000
take some time to think it over?

23:28.360 --> 23:30.280
I'll go play mahjong first.

23:30.640 --> 23:31.240
I'll let Wu

23:31.240 --> 23:32.560
show you around later.

23:33.240 --> 23:34.800
Call him if you need anything.

23:36.240 --> 23:36.920
Rub, rub the head,

23:37.200 --> 23:37.760
no need to fear.

23:53.520 --> 23:54.160
What's your problem?

23:54.920 --> 23:56.040
Why the long face?

23:56.280 --> 23:57.560
Why are you so cold to her?

23:57.920 --> 23:58.600
As kids,

23:58.600 --> 23:59.600
you two played together .

23:59.600 --> 24:00.960
You went clam digging. Remember?

24:01.640 --> 24:03.760
She is such a poor girl.

24:03.920 --> 24:05.480
Her mom passed away years ago.

24:06.040 --> 24:06.520
I think

24:06.520 --> 24:07.680
her father wouldn't

24:07.680 --> 24:08.560
send her here

24:08.560 --> 24:09.520
without encounter of real problem.

24:10.560 --> 24:11.560
Lost contact for years

24:11.960 --> 24:12.720
and she's here now because of a problem.

24:14.400 --> 24:15.560
My sister treated me well.

24:15.720 --> 24:16.560
She took me in

24:16.560 --> 24:17.600
and loved me

24:17.960 --> 24:19.280
like her own

24:19.280 --> 24:20.320
sister.

24:20.880 --> 24:22.280
She privately

24:22.600 --> 24:23.160
gave me money

24:23.160 --> 24:24.600
when I was pregnant.

24:26.840 --> 24:28.120
Be welcoming!

24:29.040 --> 24:30.160
She's our honored guest.

24:32.080 --> 24:32.880
Ye,

24:33.680 --> 24:35.160
you can turn to Liu Nian

24:35.240 --> 24:36.040
if Wu

24:36.040 --> 24:37.240
is unavailable.

24:38.960 --> 24:39.520
Wu!

24:46.840 --> 24:47.720
Where's the restroom?

24:49.360 --> 24:49.880
Outside.

24:50.400 --> 24:50.920
It's public one.

24:51.880 --> 24:52.680
Public?

24:52.960 --> 24:53.840
Something wrong?

24:56.680 --> 24:57.160
By the way,

24:57.840 --> 24:58.680
this is my grandma's room.

24:58.920 --> 24:59.600
She's resting.

24:59.920 --> 25:01.040
Don't go in unless you have to.

25:01.360 --> 25:02.360
Don't mess with things downstairs.

25:03.200 --> 25:03.800
Here's my number.

25:05.120 --> 25:05.840
I've got things to do.

25:10.120 --> 25:11.280
Call me if you need me.

27:18.880 --> 27:19.440
Mom...

27:21.760 --> 27:23.000
Sweetie, you're awake.

27:24.160 --> 27:24.640
Mom,

27:25.280 --> 27:26.840
I just had a nightmare.

27:27.360 --> 27:28.200
I'm so scared.

27:30.200 --> 27:31.160
My babe,

27:31.680 --> 27:32.880
it was just a dream.

27:33.240 --> 27:33.960
What did you dream about?

27:34.200 --> 27:35.200
Tell me.

27:36.880 --> 27:38.080
I dreamed of a place

27:38.640 --> 27:39.960
called Zhazhating

27:41.080 --> 27:42.200
where I met

27:42.600 --> 27:43.840
my aunt, Li Lanfang,

27:44.600 --> 27:46.040
her son, Xing Wu,

27:47.080 --> 27:47.680
along with

27:48.440 --> 27:50.200
his weird-looking friends.

27:51.000 --> 27:52.360
They had their hair dyed

27:52.720 --> 27:53.800
in all sorts of colors

27:53.800 --> 27:54.640
and acted really rudely.

27:55.160 --> 27:56.400
I don't like them at all.

27:57.920 --> 27:58.560
Don't be afraid.

27:59.160 --> 28:00.480
It's just a dream.

28:16.480 --> 28:16.960
Mom?

28:18.960 --> 28:19.440
Mom?

28:20.040 --> 28:20.560
Mom?

28:21.040 --> 28:21.560
Mom?

28:31.080 --> 28:31.920
Why are you here?

28:32.360 --> 28:33.040
Had a nightmare?

28:35.480 --> 28:36.040
No, I don't.

28:38.720 --> 28:39.360
Good to hear that.

28:43.040 --> 28:44.040
What's up?

28:45.760 --> 28:46.840
Distinguished guest,

28:47.440 --> 28:48.880
my mom asks you for dinner.

28:51.200 --> 28:51.880
I got it.

29:05.760 --> 29:06.280
Ye,

29:06.480 --> 29:07.360
come and have dinner.

29:10.280 --> 29:11.040
Auntie,

29:11.880 --> 29:12.720
is the light

29:12.960 --> 29:13.840
always dim?

29:15.360 --> 29:15.760
Yep.

29:17.280 --> 29:18.560
Do you ask your grandma?

29:18.960 --> 29:20.520
Does she wanna eat here

29:20.520 --> 29:21.600
or in her room?

29:21.920 --> 29:23.040
She says she's not hungry.

29:26.120 --> 29:27.360
His grandma has bad legs.

29:29.080 --> 29:29.840
I cooked

29:30.160 --> 29:31.400
three dishes specially

29:31.720 --> 29:33.160
to welcome you.

29:33.480 --> 29:34.480
The soup will be ready

29:34.720 --> 29:35.480
in a minute.

29:36.680 --> 29:37.360
Ye,

29:37.800 --> 29:39.680
have some meat first.

29:41.960 --> 29:42.560
Thanks.

29:43.160 --> 29:44.040
I don't eat meat in the evening.

29:46.240 --> 29:47.000
No meat?

29:47.800 --> 29:48.960
You're still growing up.

29:48.960 --> 29:50.320
You need meat!

29:50.480 --> 29:51.960
Too much fat

29:52.080 --> 29:53.040
harms health.

29:54.960 --> 29:55.800
So have seafood.

29:56.640 --> 29:57.440
Clams won't make you fat.

29:57.640 --> 29:58.080
Have it.

29:59.600 --> 30:00.960
As an old saying goes,

30:01.360 --> 30:03.800
seafood cooked

30:03.840 --> 30:05.000
with lard

30:05.680 --> 30:06.880
tastes amazing!

30:08.200 --> 30:10.160
Delicious!

30:10.240 --> 30:11.360
I don't eat lard.

30:14.360 --> 30:15.360
Suit yourself.

30:15.680 --> 30:16.440
Wu,

30:17.120 --> 30:18.240
get her

30:18.960 --> 30:20.000
a bowl of noodles.

30:20.280 --> 30:20.920
No need.

30:21.680 --> 30:22.440
I'm not hungry

30:25.040 --> 30:26.000
I came down

30:26.000 --> 30:27.080
to show you this

30:32.960 --> 30:35.040
accommodation service contract.

30:35.680 --> 30:37.240
Stay in a hotel if you have money.

30:37.760 --> 30:38.560
Such a childish contract

30:38.560 --> 30:39.400
means nothing here.

30:39.720 --> 30:41.200
What's wrong with the contract?

30:41.360 --> 30:42.760
Ye has given the money.

30:43.000 --> 30:43.440
Signing a contract

30:43.440 --> 30:44.480
is just routine.

30:44.840 --> 30:45.640
Okay. I'll sign.

30:45.960 --> 30:47.000
You city folks

30:47.240 --> 30:48.240
really stick to rules.

30:49.760 --> 30:51.000
One more thing.

30:52.480 --> 30:54.000
I won't

30:54.080 --> 30:55.360
pay the balance

30:55.360 --> 30:56.200
if my

30:56.280 --> 30:57.280
personal safety

30:58.040 --> 30:58.640
gets threatened

30:58.840 --> 30:59.760
during my stay here.

31:00.520 --> 31:01.280
Don't worry.

31:02.560 --> 31:03.560
Nothing like that

31:03.560 --> 31:04.560
will happen.

31:06.360 --> 31:07.160
I hope so.

31:10.520 --> 31:11.000
Fine.

31:11.080 --> 31:12.000
Two copies in total.

31:12.520 --> 31:13.200
Keep one for yourself.

31:13.600 --> 31:14.040
Okay.

31:16.720 --> 31:17.360
I'm heading upstairs

31:20.440 --> 31:22.160
Sure you won't eat anything?

31:22.760 --> 31:23.360
I'm not hungry.

31:31.440 --> 31:32.760
Our life is tough enough.

31:33.200 --> 31:34.480
Why do we take on such a demanding guest?

31:34.960 --> 31:35.920
Before doing that,

31:35.920 --> 31:37.000
could you please figure out

31:37.000 --> 31:37.560
how to live life?

31:39.360 --> 31:40.440
Our hardship

31:40.440 --> 31:41.040
is all

31:41.040 --> 31:41.840
because of

31:42.760 --> 31:43.920
your unreliable father,

31:44.040 --> 31:45.120
Xing Guodong.

31:45.960 --> 31:47.480
He gambled away

31:47.480 --> 31:48.360
my shop.

31:48.360 --> 31:49.640
Or would I scrape every penny

31:49.720 --> 31:50.360
at the cost of

31:50.360 --> 31:51.200
your tuition and

31:51.200 --> 31:52.360
your grandmother's medical bills?

31:52.920 --> 31:53.360
Do you think

31:53.360 --> 31:54.600
fixing gadgets

31:54.720 --> 31:56.000
can pay off such huge debts?

31:56.160 --> 31:56.800
Okay. Enough.

31:56.800 --> 31:57.600
It's not enough!

31:57.600 --> 31:58.600
I'm not finished!

31:58.880 --> 32:00.360
Your grandma has trouble getting around now

32:00.480 --> 32:01.400
and has epilepsy.

32:01.760 --> 32:02.520
Going to the hospital

32:02.520 --> 32:03.600
also needs money.

32:04.040 --> 32:04.840
Let me tell you!

32:05.000 --> 32:05.800
If it weren't for

32:05.800 --> 32:07.120
30,000 yuan from Qing Ye today,

32:07.520 --> 32:09.400
from now on, you, me, your grandma,

32:09.560 --> 32:11.160
we'd all be in deep trouble

32:11.160 --> 32:12.160
with those debt collectors.

32:12.200 --> 32:12.840
So,

32:13.280 --> 32:14.680
she's our savior right now.

32:14.720 --> 32:15.680
We have to treat her like royalty.

32:24.440 --> 32:25.080
I know.

32:26.840 --> 32:27.680
For the sake of this family,

32:27.680 --> 32:28.560
you have had a really hard time.

32:30.120 --> 32:31.200
As a mother,

32:32.200 --> 32:32.920
I feel sorry for you.

32:33.160 --> 32:34.200
I don't want you to be so tired.

32:35.960 --> 32:37.120
Let's pay off the debt first.

32:37.840 --> 32:38.920
Then, work a little harder,

32:39.920 --> 32:40.600
and maybe you

32:40.720 --> 32:42.280
can go back to school.

32:43.800 --> 32:45.120
I believe with your ability,

32:45.840 --> 32:47.040
you can definitely be admitted

32:47.040 --> 32:47.960
to a good university.

32:48.280 --> 32:50.640
Studying is the right path.

32:51.920 --> 32:53.240
Who said I wanted to go to university?

32:55.440 --> 32:56.560
I can support this family.

33:00.080 --> 33:01.520
Then, could we consider this money as a loan?

33:02.720 --> 33:03.880
When we have money in the future,

33:03.880 --> 33:05.000
we pay her back, okay?

33:05.040 --> 33:06.080
Do you know, she,

33:06.080 --> 33:07.120
for our family,

33:07.160 --> 33:08.200
is like a handful of useless tiles

33:08.200 --> 33:09.520
that suddenly drew a winning hand.

33:10.600 --> 33:11.040
Li Lanfang,

33:11.040 --> 33:12.080
how could you compare everything

33:12.280 --> 33:13.440
to playing mahjong?

33:14.560 --> 33:16.000
My son,

33:16.000 --> 33:16.960
in life,

33:16.960 --> 33:19.000
you need something to hold onto.

33:19.200 --> 33:20.160
You can't overthink

33:20.160 --> 33:21.240
every single thing.

33:21.360 --> 33:22.160
Take myself, for example.

33:22.800 --> 33:23.520
In my whole life,

33:23.880 --> 33:25.040
I've been paying off your dad's debt.

33:26.000 --> 33:26.760
And you,

33:27.880 --> 33:28.920
you're just paying my debt.

33:32.040 --> 33:33.320
I went through a lot,

33:33.440 --> 33:34.520
giving birth to you.

33:37.920 --> 33:39.920
Actually, I'm not hungry.

33:42.960 --> 33:43.960
Play mahjong again?

33:44.440 --> 33:45.960
Please allow me.

33:46.040 --> 33:46.680
Okay?

33:47.360 --> 33:48.200
Fine. Just go.

33:49.160 --> 33:49.680
Thank you.

33:49.720 --> 33:50.680
Remember to clean up

33:50.680 --> 33:51.360
all this stuff, okay?

34:12.400 --> 34:13.280
[Wu,]

34:14.000 --> 34:14.920
[Wu.]

34:20.000 --> 34:21.360
- [Grandma.]
- [Come in.]

34:21.480 --> 34:21.920
[Be careful.]

34:23.880 --> 34:24.760
[I know]

34:24.840 --> 34:26.360
[both you and your mother have it hard.]

34:26.840 --> 34:28.080
[Don't be angry with her.]

34:28.719 --> 34:29.840
[Just let her go.]

34:30.280 --> 34:31.480
[When she's playing mahjong,]

34:31.480 --> 34:32.600
[she's actually a bit happier.]

34:36.719 --> 34:37.520
Got it, grandma.

34:38.600 --> 34:39.880
I'll go get you some food.

34:41.159 --> 34:41.880
I'm not hungry.

34:42.600 --> 34:44.679
Eating too much late isn't good for digestion.

34:46.960 --> 34:47.600
Don't you like

34:47.600 --> 34:48.600
sea urchin with steamed egg?

34:49.120 --> 34:50.120
When I get paid,

34:50.400 --> 34:51.120
I'll buy it for you.

34:53.120 --> 34:55.199
My grandson is so thoughtful.

35:02.240 --> 35:02.760
What's wrong?

35:04.040 --> 35:05.080
Must be a power outage.

35:06.440 --> 35:07.320
I'll go check, grandma.

35:17.640 --> 35:19.560
I was in such a hurry to leave this time.

35:19.560 --> 35:20.800
I didn't bring anything with me.

35:21.440 --> 35:23.160
I left my computer at school.

35:24.040 --> 35:25.360
[Okay, I'll send it to you tomorrow.]

35:27.040 --> 35:28.120
You need to send it express.

35:28.360 --> 35:29.120
I need it for course registration.

35:29.200 --> 35:30.840
[Okay, don't worry.]

35:31.920 --> 35:32.440
[Qing Ye,]

35:32.760 --> 35:34.120
[how long do you plan on staying over there?]

35:35.440 --> 35:36.760
I've made an estimate...

35:36.840 --> 35:37.520
You see,

35:38.000 --> 35:38.920
course registration,

35:38.920 --> 35:40.040
and waiting for my visa.

35:40.400 --> 35:41.200
Oh, Leling,

35:41.600 --> 35:42.920
the proof of assets I need,

35:43.040 --> 35:44.040
did you get it ready for me?

35:44.760 --> 35:45.440
[Almost.]

35:45.760 --> 35:47.000
[I asked my mom to help with the funds.]

35:47.040 --> 35:48.240
[It should be done by next week.]

35:48.400 --> 35:49.560
That's great.

35:49.920 --> 35:51.360
Then I'm guessing about a month,

35:51.880 --> 35:52.400
and I can

35:52.640 --> 35:53.480
get out of

35:53.480 --> 35:54.640
this crappy place.

35:55.240 --> 35:55.880
Check this out.

35:57.560 --> 35:58.120
[Qing Ye,]

35:58.400 --> 35:59.600
[Why don't you turn on the lights?]

36:01.360 --> 36:02.160
Can you believe it?

36:02.440 --> 36:03.280
The power's out here.

36:03.560 --> 36:04.280
[Power out?]

36:04.560 --> 36:05.720
[How could it be?]

36:06.120 --> 36:06.760
[Qing Ye,]

36:07.160 --> 36:08.520
[do you really go on a reality show like "X-change"?]

36:09.520 --> 36:11.040
Let me tell you.

36:11.360 --> 36:12.560
It's insane.

36:13.080 --> 36:13.560
Forget it.

36:14.840 --> 36:15.720
I don't wanna talk about it.

36:16.800 --> 36:17.960
[Don't you have a cousin there?]

36:18.000 --> 36:18.560
[What about him?]

36:19.760 --> 36:20.440
He?

36:21.080 --> 36:22.080
I don't even know where to start.

36:22.080 --> 36:22.880
His hair

36:23.120 --> 36:24.400
is like not quite blonde, not quite silver,

36:24.680 --> 36:25.640
and he has a bad temper.

36:25.960 --> 36:26.520
He's exactly

36:26.520 --> 36:28.600
the kind of "bleached-hair punk" you'd imagine.

36:28.840 --> 36:30.120
Like a little thug.

36:30.400 --> 36:31.080
[Qing Ye,]

36:31.520 --> 36:32.560
[there's a ghost behind you.]

36:36.160 --> 36:36.480
Jesus.

36:36.520 --> 36:37.240
How come you can walk,

36:37.240 --> 36:38.240
without making a sound?

36:38.400 --> 36:39.200
No sound is perfect.

36:39.200 --> 36:40.880
It lets me hear you trash-talking people behind their backs.

36:42.280 --> 36:43.240
I'll hang up the video.

36:51.440 --> 36:52.080
Stay in the dark.

37:24.560 --> 37:25.680
Do you smell it?

37:25.680 --> 37:26.800
Why is it so stinging?

37:29.480 --> 37:30.520
Haven't you used mosquito coils before?

37:30.800 --> 37:32.120
Don't you have an electric mosquito repellent?

37:32.400 --> 37:33.560
The odorless, non-toxic kind?

37:33.840 --> 37:35.400
This area is known for its sea mosquitoes.

37:35.640 --> 37:37.160
Mosquito coils work the best.

37:41.080 --> 37:41.600
By the way,

37:43.520 --> 37:44.400
a friendly tip for you.

37:45.360 --> 37:46.080
These mosquitoes

37:46.400 --> 37:47.640
can bite a pig to death.

37:47.960 --> 37:48.880
How many times have you been bitten?

37:49.120 --> 37:49.800
Who are you calling a pig?

37:51.480 --> 37:52.440
It seems like my assessment of you

37:52.440 --> 37:53.480
wasn't complete enough.

37:53.840 --> 37:54.360
I'll add two more.

37:54.440 --> 37:55.280
Sarcastic,

37:55.600 --> 37:56.560
and pretentious.

37:57.240 --> 37:57.760
Also,

37:58.440 --> 37:59.520
talk to me less from now on.

37:59.840 --> 38:00.560
I'm a clean freak.

38:14.040 --> 38:14.880
What now?

38:15.120 --> 38:15.880
Another blackout?

38:18.720 --> 38:19.440
What are you doing?

38:19.960 --> 38:21.040
You said it was too dark.

38:21.440 --> 38:22.360
So I wanna get you a brighter bulb.

38:34.200 --> 38:35.120
Don't just sit there.

38:35.880 --> 38:36.400
The bulb.

38:36.640 --> 38:37.400
Give it to me.

38:39.240 --> 38:40.440
Can't you get it yourself?

38:50.680 --> 38:51.720
You don't have to look at me like that.

38:53.200 --> 38:53.960
At most one month later,

38:54.200 --> 38:55.000
I'll be out of here

38:55.000 --> 38:55.840
for further study abroad.

38:56.040 --> 38:56.600
As for me,

38:56.760 --> 38:58.720
I'll just treat this as a summer vacation here.

38:58.760 --> 38:59.480
During this time,

38:59.480 --> 39:00.960
you have the right to be annoyed, to dislike me,

39:00.960 --> 39:01.600
and not to stand me.

39:01.920 --> 39:02.760
But I won't change.

39:06.280 --> 39:07.960
That's just how it is between party A and party B.

39:08.280 --> 39:09.440
We tolerate each other for one month,

39:09.760 --> 39:10.480
and then it's over.

39:23.880 --> 39:25.000
One month at most.

39:25.360 --> 39:26.240
Leave as soon as you can.

39:26.680 --> 39:27.560
Never see each other again.

39:28.160 --> 39:29.280
That's also what I'm thinking.

39:32.880 --> 39:33.480
Wait a minute.

39:35.360 --> 39:36.600
There are so many sea mosquitoes here.

39:36.600 --> 39:38.160
Do you have any special mosquito repellent

39:38.720 --> 39:39.760
or even some floral water lotion?

39:42.000 --> 39:42.600
This is all I've got.

39:43.360 --> 39:44.280
Does that work?

39:44.280 --> 39:45.360
I don't like the smell.

39:45.560 --> 39:47.240
Don't be so picky unless you want scars from scratching.

39:47.800 --> 39:48.600
Suit yourself.

39:52.120 --> 39:52.720
Hold on a sec.

39:55.400 --> 39:56.080
Where's the bathroom?

40:10.480 --> 40:10.920
Here we are.

40:12.480 --> 40:13.000
Right here.

40:17.800 --> 40:19.320
This is...the bathroom?

40:19.680 --> 40:20.200
Yep.

40:20.800 --> 40:21.880
Public bathroom.

40:22.280 --> 40:22.760
Wait.

40:23.200 --> 40:24.320
How can you share a shower

40:24.320 --> 40:25.720
with your neighbors?

40:25.880 --> 40:26.680
In Zhazhating,

40:27.280 --> 40:28.000
this is what we've got.

40:35.680 --> 40:36.080
Right here.

40:36.120 --> 40:37.680
Why is it so smelly?

40:40.560 --> 40:41.760
That's all rusted.

40:45.000 --> 40:46.800
The floor is so dirty.

40:49.200 --> 40:50.960
It's even bulk shampoo!

40:50.960 --> 40:52.160
How can I take a shower with these?

40:53.640 --> 40:54.280
Water heater.

40:54.680 --> 40:55.360
Showerhead.

40:55.560 --> 40:56.520
Why can't you shower?

40:57.480 --> 40:58.160
In Zhazhating,

40:58.920 --> 40:59.640
this is what we've got.

41:00.240 --> 41:01.120
What about the door?

41:01.480 --> 41:02.360
How can I lock this door?

41:11.680 --> 41:12.160
What?

41:18.040 --> 41:19.200
There's even a hole here.

41:19.840 --> 41:20.680
It's old and worn out.

41:21.080 --> 41:21.640
Broken.

41:21.840 --> 41:23.000
Are you kidding me?

41:23.880 --> 41:25.040
What if someone comes by,

41:25.200 --> 41:27.040
crouches down, and sees me showering?

41:27.120 --> 41:28.000
On such a hot day,

41:28.000 --> 41:28.840
nobody's going out of their way

41:28.840 --> 41:29.760
to peek at you showering.

41:30.320 --> 41:31.080
Just pull that curtain

41:31.120 --> 41:32.120
and you're fine.

41:33.200 --> 41:34.720
This is what we've got in Zhazhating.

41:40.360 --> 41:41.200
The shampoo...

41:42.720 --> 41:44.280
Is there any other shampoo?

41:46.400 --> 41:46.880
Yes.

41:47.840 --> 41:48.560
Wait a bit.

41:50.440 --> 41:51.080
Body wash?

41:51.840 --> 41:52.400
Soup.

41:55.520 --> 41:56.680
I can't stand using soap.

41:59.120 --> 41:59.560
Alright.

42:00.920 --> 42:01.800
Whatever conditions you have,

42:02.320 --> 42:03.160
speak all out at once.

42:05.000 --> 42:05.600
Shampoo.

42:05.720 --> 42:07.080
I need silicone‑free shampoo,

42:07.320 --> 42:09.000
and niacinamide face wash.

42:09.400 --> 42:10.360
For toothpaste, I'd like...

42:17.200 --> 42:17.720
Forget it.

42:18.480 --> 42:19.440
It's only a month anyway.

42:20.400 --> 42:21.040
I'll suck it up.

43:16.120 --> 43:16.720
Xing Wu!

43:16.760 --> 43:17.520
Ugh... I...

43:17.760 --> 43:18.240
What's wrong?

43:19.280 --> 43:21.320
Th‑there…there are bugs!

43:22.120 --> 43:22.680
Bugs?

43:23.200 --> 43:24.360
So many bugs!

43:30.160 --> 43:31.160
You see them?

43:31.840 --> 43:32.640
There are no bugs.

43:32.920 --> 43:33.880
There are lots!

43:34.280 --> 43:34.840
You mean this?

43:36.040 --> 43:37.640
Don't! Don't! Stay away!
